sections.text:
{{Dia|red|Marissa Faireborn|Commander, the field looks clear but I promise you it is not.}}
{{DiaC|red|Teletraan reports energy spikes indicating a multitude of cloaked hostiles.}}
{{DiaC|red|Ready your team for a fight and proceed at high alert.}}

{{Dia|red|Marissa Faireborn|Commander, another cloaking field seems to be set up.}}
{{DiaC|red|Energon signals all over the map. Not sure if they are coming from that duplicate dimension.}}
{{DiaC|red|You may see some familiar faces, but don't hold back... I don't think they will be playing nice.}}

{{Quotes|Oh no Commander...

Wheeljack has been experimenting on a device that could harness the many new and strange energies on New Quintessa. His new, and untested, Chrono-Vector Device could POTENTIALLY allow the user to travel along a time-bridge. Unfortunately the first unexpected test-run is manned by Grimlock, a dinobot on a mission.

Can Wheeljack and Optimus Prime stop the mighty Grimlock from unravelling the past? Only TIME will tell!}}

