sections.text:
{{Dia|red|Prowl|Evidence Log 917-84: Recent assault on Autobot base of operations being investigated...}}
{{DiaC|red|...Nose Cone impacts and a partial Grill print indicate a combined assault from Decepticons Ramjet and Motormaster.}}
{{DiaC|red|In pursuit of suspects. Decepticons think they can become vandals just because the world is ripping apart.}}

* Prowl: Log 917-84 continued: Ratchet is overzealous but not incorrect. Protocol is failing me. No more dealing with henchmen, I'm going straight for their bosses...
* However as I approach a known lair of Megatron, a 10-16 may be in progress.
* Megatron: {{RedText|A CORRUPTION IS WHAT YOU ARE! YOU STINK OF UNICRON!}}
* Galvatron: {{RedText|JEALOUSY! YOUR PATHETIC FORM IS WHAT FAILED US!}}
* Megatron: {{RedText|THESE ARE THE HANDS THAT SLAYED PRIME!}}

* Prowl: Megatron you're wanted for questioning in connection the the disappearance of Optimus Prime.
* Megatron: FOOL! I haven't meddled with that pathetic junkyard reject. I was speaking only when I first bested him.
* Galvatron: Hot Rod had more claim on that victory than you did, you were a limping wreck ready for the scrap heap.
* Megatron: {{RedText|WHO ARE YOU TO SAY!?}}
* Galvatron: {{RedText|I WAS THERE! I KNOW THE BITTER STING OF OUR DEFEAT!}}
* Megatron: You want to see a scrapped Autobot? Watch as I turn Prowl to powder!

* Starscream: Just...like I planned it.
* Prowl: I've changed my opinion on you Starscream. Your spark is black as midnight on a moonless night.
* Starscream: Your friend paid well for this reunion...
* Grimlock: {{RedText|JET BOT BRING POLICE BOT! YOU COME WITH GRIMLOCK NOW!}}
* Prowl: Grimlock? There's no way you took out a bounty on me...
* Grimlock: {{RedText|GRIMLOCK DO JOB! KNOCK DOWN POLICE BOT!}}

