sections.text:
THIS SPOTLIGHT MISSION IS BRAND NEW, SO TO BE SURE...

{{Spoiler Warning}}

SPOILER. ALERT.

{{Dia|red|Marissa Faireborn|Optimus, Bumblebee, we've been given Prowl's Evidence Log. There's also...an unique and troubling detail we need to discuss.}}
{{Dia|darkred|Optimus Prime|That should shed light on the disappearance of Prowl and his Prime. What is the missing detail?}}
{{Dia|red|Marissa Faireborn|It's about WHO delivered the message. Megatron and Starscream.}}
{{Dia|darkred|Bumblebee|They looking for a reward? Turning themselves in? Offering to fight each other for our amusement?}}
{{Dia|red|Marissa Faireborn|This seems weird I know but I promise we can explain...}}
{{Dia|#4B4B4B|Megatron (Shattered Glass)|Indeed, Captain Faireborn. We would be honored to have the opportunity to state our case.}}
{{Dia|darkred|Bumblebee|...I just had a chill go along my transmission.}}

{{Dia|#4B4B4B|Starscream (Shattered Glass)|Hey, we totally understand how this seems odd. Trust us it's throwing us for a loop to see you two.}}
{{Dia|darkred|Bumblebee|Only loop you're doing is to turn tail and jet out of here as you Star-Scram!}}
{{Dia|#4B4B4B|Starscream (Shattered Glass)|Hah, did you just think about that? It's quite clever. Star-Scram. Like my name, but telling me to leave.}}
{{Dia|darkred|Bumblebee|...I hate everything that is happening right now. Maybe you need a brawl to drop the act.}}
{{Dia|#4B4B4B|Starscream (Shattered Glass)|I never seek battle as a first option, but I will protect myself if forced to action.}}
{{Dia|darkred|Bumblebee|...What is HAPPENING right now?}}

{{Dia|#4B4B4B|Megatron (Shattered Glass)|Hopefully that is out of your system. May we please tell you why we returned Prowl's recordings?}}
{{Dia|darkred|Optimus Prime|Prowl was behaving oddly, may have harmed his own Prime. We shall run an internal investigation. You can be on your way.}}
{{Dia|#4B4B4B|Megatron (Shattered Glass)|Perhaps this would be better if I just spoke to your Commander privately? Is there some way they and I could be left alone?}}
{{Dia|darkred|Optimus Prime|So that's what this is about. Getting to the Commander. The only way you are alone in a room with them is if I have been atomized.}}
{{Dia|#4B4B4B|Megatron (Shattered Glass)|Please, we do not have time to let anger dominate this meeting.}}
{{Dia|red|Marissa Faireborn|Prime, my scans DO indicate that--}}
{{Dia|darkred|Optimus Prime|In a moment Faireborn! I have some Decepticon trash to throw out.}}

*Special Missions, when locked, shows whatseems to be Nemesis Prime. This was the closest instance of Optimus Prime's evil clone appearing in the game.

